  "updated_at": "2026-04-03",
  "bio": "Rhuan Santos, an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist, excels in the 'black&gray' tattoo style. Based in Palhoça, Brazil, Santos is known for his dynamite work at BeatInk Tattoo and collaborations with Dirty Ghetto Jeans. He's a member of the potent Poder Supremo Crew, renowned for delivering strikingly detailed, creative tattoos.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Palhoça, Santa Catarina, Brazil"
}